Dear Samuella,

Thank you for your application for the position of Care Worker / Support Worker with CareGroove Support Ltd.

We appreciate the time and effort you have taken to apply and your interest in joining our team.

Your application is currently under review, and we will be in touch with you as soon as possible regarding the outcome.

Thank you once again for considering a career with CareGroove Support Ltd.

Kind regards,
CareGroove Support Ltd Recruitment Team

