> Hello Recruitment Team,
> I hope this message finds you well. My name is Samuella Fosu Koduah, and I am currently pursuing a master's degree in business management at the University of Hull. I am writing to express my interest in joining your team. Through my experience working with agencies as a support worker, I have gained valuable hands-on experience in providing care and ensuring individuals feel supported, respected, and valued. This role has strengthened my ability to be patient, compassionate, and dedicated in delivering high-quality care.
> I take pride in giving my best in everything I do, and I am confident that joining your team will allow me to further contribute positively to the wellbeing of those in your care while continuing to grow professionally.
> Please find my CV attached for your consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss my application further.
> Kind regards,
> Samuella Fosu Koduah
